{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e4795623e8afa68f","name":"Superior Skills Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-e4795623e8afa68f","title":"Superior Skills Talent Tree","revision":21261,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:27:21Z","sha256":"964d64c720269b5ccae956aa1331ebd7b974e7c145c73b8951bf8dfbeb43099b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21261","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Superior%20Skills%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e4795623e8afa68f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You're not just good at what you do, you're the best. Failure is but a stumbling block, and great success always follows.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Assured Skill"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you select this Talent, choose one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},". Whenever you roll a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," with that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},", you can choose to lose any competence bonuses to that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," and instead roll twice, keeping either result.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you must choose a different ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," to gain the benefits of this Talent.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Critical Skill Success"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you roll a Natural 20 on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},", choose one other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},". Once before the end of your next turn, you can choose to gain a +5 competence bonus to a check with that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Exceptional Skill"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you select this Talent, choose one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"},". Whenever you roll a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," with that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},", a result of 2-7 on the die is always treated as though you had rolled an 8.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you must choose a different ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," to gain the benefits of this Talent.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Reliable Boon"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to add to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},", you always reroll a result of 1 on any of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," dice, and continue to reroll until you get a result of 2 or higher.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Skill Boon"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you select this Talent, choose one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"},". Whenever you spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to add to that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},", increase the die type of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," by one step (i.e. from d6 to d8, d8 to d10, d10 to d12), to a maximum of d12.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you must choose a different ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," to gain the benefits of this Talent.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Skill Confidence"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Critical Skill Success"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you select this Talent, choose one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"},". Whenever you roll a Natural 19 or a Natural 20 on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," with that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},", you gain the benefits of the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Critical Skill Success"]}," Talent and also gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," modifier.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you must choose a different ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," to gain the benefits of this Talent.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Skillful Recovery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you select this Talent, choose one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"},". Whenever you fail a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," with that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},", you gain one temporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"},". That ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," can only be spent to add to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," you chose for this Talent. If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," is not spent by the end of the encounter, it is lost. For the purposes of this Talent, failing a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," means failing to get the minimum possible result from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you must choose a different ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," to gain the benefits of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
